hing is quiet then it is smart.**.\n   - This tells us that if something is quiet, then it is smart.But we don\'t have information about Charlie being quiet.\n\n10.**All blue things are young.**.\n    - This tells us that all blue things belong to the category of young things.\n\n11.**Big, blue things are quiet.**.\n    - This tells us that big blue things are quiet.However, we don\'t have information about Charlie being big.\n\n12.**Young, white things are round.**.\nThe statement "All blue things are young." is false.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
