If someone is white then they are big.** This means that if someone is white, they are also big.\n12.**If someone is rough then they are green.** This means that if someone is rough, they are also green.\n13.**If someone is kind and not big then they are not rough.** This means that if someone is kind but not big, they are not rough.\n14.**Furry, white people are rough.Dave is possibly white.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
